# Ignore AVD-DS-0031: ENV STEAM_PASSWORD is an empty placeholder for runtime injection.
# The actual password is passed at container runtime via `docker run -e STEAM_PASSWORD=...`
# or via Docker Compose / Kubernetes secrets. No secret is baked into the image.
AVD-DS-0031

# Go stdlib CVEs in /usr/bin/pebble (Go 1.26.7), shipped by the ubuntu:devel
# base image since ~Sept 2026. Pebble is unused by steamcmd, is not owned by
# any deb package, and can therefore not be fixed via apt upgrade.
# Fixed upstream in Go 1.26.9 / 1.27.2 — drop these once the base image
# ships a fixed Go toolchain. Added 2026-10-14.
CVE-2026-78667
CVE-2026-78669
CVE-2026-97031
